  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">오늘 반장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">부반장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">총무 선출이 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">우리 반 아이들의 특성을 고려하여 올해는 다음과 같은 팀을 구성하여 학급을 운영하려 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">각 팀에는 팀장이 한 명씩 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">구성원들은 자율적으로 정하도록 할 예정입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">과학실 실험대가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">개인데 우리 반은 과학 시간에도 팀별로 앉습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.  </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">학습팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">수행평가 등 과제 알림</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">과목별 학습 도우미</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">수행평가를 어떻게 해야 하는지 시작 단계에서 모르는 아이들 의외로 많더라고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">매 년 학습팀의 역할이 중요하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">교수기기팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) :  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">핸드폰 관리</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">방송시간에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">TV </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">관리</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">우리학교는 아침에 스마트폰을 거두고 귀가시간에 내어줍니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">매년 이 일을 담당하는 아이들은 유심카드까지 체크하는 치밀함을 보였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">행사팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">체육대회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">합창대회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">축제 등 모든 교내 행사 계획</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">학급내 역할 정하기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">응원도구 제작 및 결정</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">용의팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">교칙에 벗어나지 않은 범위에서 학급 내 용의규정을 정하고 잘 지켜지도록 활동하는 팀</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">환경팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">환경을 살리는 일을 계획하고 실천하는 팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">예 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">재활용품 관리</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, EM</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">활용</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">학급 게시물 관리</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">경청</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">귀를 기울여 들음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">또래상담 도우미</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">친구 상호간에 불편한 일이 발생하였을 때<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">…</span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">반장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">부반장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">총무는 고유의 역할을 수행하면서 자신의 성격에 맞는 학습팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">경청팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">용의팀에 각각 들어갔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">그 팀 안에서는 팀장이 리더가 됩니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">팀의 이름과 역할은 학급 아이들의 성격에 맞게 조정하여 정하시면 될 것 같습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. ^^&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
